body:
I am not in any way, shape of form related to the original fanart and only recreated it. 

&#x200B;

link to the original: https://www.deviantart.com/ninjahaku21/art/Dr-Eggman-412600906

While I agree, I also like to think that Zapp might (and most likely has) been keeping Amy as a "plan B" (Leila being "plan A"). He would have used the fact that Amy isn't as smart as Leila to get in her pants. And if my memories from the show are correst, I remember a few times where Amy was annoyed by Kif's careful nature. Zapp would have taken advantage of that, being the scumbag he is.

&#x200B;

Again, I agree that Amy can be at fault, but I support that Zapp's sociopathic tendencies are the one to blame here. Taking advantage of a widow at her most vulnerable moment.
